# Portfolio git workflow

## Working branch

- Default branch for all edits and commits: **`portfolio-update-by-afaf`**.
- Before making changes, ensure the repo is on `portfolio-update-by-afaf` (`git checkout portfolio-update-by-afaf` if needed).
- Do **not** `git checkout main` or other branches unless the user explicitly asks.

## Main and deploy

- The user merges **`portfolio-update-by-afaf` → `main`** (e.g. via PR). Do **not** merge into `main`, push `main`, or open/merge PRs unless the user explicitly requests it.
- Production site is **`gh-pages`** via `npm run deploy` from **`main`** after merge. Do **not** run `npm run deploy` unless the user explicitly asks (after they have merged to `main`).

## Push

- Push feature work to **`origin portfolio-update-by-afaf`** when the user asks to push, unless they specify otherwise.

## Resume PDF

- Source of truth: **`src/assets/resume/Afaf_Athar_ML.pdf`**, imported in `Contact.tsx`. Keep **`public/Afaf_Athar_ML.pdf`** in sync if it remains in the repo.
